		{
			dependencies: ["31BDC4E9DEDDC05C"]
			description: [
				"The Time in a Bottle is a powerful item that lets you tick-acclerate machines. You have to build up time by keeping it in your inventory, and you can only have one per player."
				""
				"It is available pretty early on, since it will get most of its utility from the earlygame. Make sure not to over-rely on it, as hopping around your base speeding up machines isn't a sustainable strategy, and &osome machines cannot be sped up!&r"
			]
