		{
			dependencies: ["1740ED183C620BC8"]
			description: [
				"This modpack uses GregTech to handle its multiblocks. These multiblocks have a few nuances to keep in mind."
				""
				"First, you will need to craft hatches for your multiblocks. While the item/fluid hatches are pretty straightforward, the energy hatches need a bit more thought. "
				""
				"In this pack, GregTech hatches are configured to take RF at a ratio of 4 RF to 1 EU. So if a recipe says it takes 64 EU/t, it actually takes 256 RF/t."
				""
				"Multiblocks that take power can overclock if given a higher-tier energy hatch, using 4x the power to run the recipe twice as fast. For example, the recipe that uses 64 EU/t (256 RF/t) runs at MV, so giving it an HV hatch would make it run at 256 EU/t (1024 RF/t) and twice as fast."
				""
				"You can use a Terminal to auto-build multiblocks, though this often struggles with hatch placement."
			]
			id: "07D62C05A735018B"
			rewards: [{
				id: "101617E97728E885"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 4
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "2AEF70AC41D27363"
				title: "A Note on Multiblocks"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: 6.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["07D62C05A735018B"]
			description: [
				"Cosmic tools are a custom tier of GregTech tools with the traits of being unbreakable and having a great mining speed. They are pretty cheap to craft at this stage, as long as you have Cobalt."
				""
				"Wrenches let you rotate or break GregTech components."
				""
				"Screwdrivers let you configure covers, of which there are only a few."
				""
				"Soft Mallets let you pause a multiblock's operation, though it requires finishing the current craft."
				""
				"Crowbars can remove covers."
			]
